  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Mix all the ingredients except the olive oil in a bowl to a uniform batter."
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 1 tbsp olive oil in a 25 cm pan over medium heat. Fry the fritters (3 tbsp of batter for each) for about 3 minutes on each side until browned, adding 1 tbsp oil to the pan after each batch."
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle with chopped dill and serve with sour cream."
    }
